c/components/UserReviewsList.tsx` (85 lines)\n- List of reviews written by the current user\n- StarRating sub-component (16 lines)\n- Review cards with property link, date, rating, comment\n- Empty state message\n- Loading state\n- Used on Profile page\n\n### 5. Playwright Configuration\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\n{\n  testDir: './tests',\n  timeout: 60000,\n  expect: { timeout: 10000 },\n  fullyParallel: false,\n  forbidOnly: true,\n  retries: 0,\n  workers: 1,\n  reporter: [\n    replayReporter({ upload: false }),\n    ['json', { outputFile: 'test-results/results.json' }],\n    ['html', { open: 'never' }]\n  ],\n  use: {\n    ...replayDevices['Replay Chromium'],\n    baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888',\n    trace: 'on-first-retry',\n    actionTimeout: 15000,\n  },\n  webServer: {\n    command: 'npx netlify dev --port 8888 --functions ./netlify/functions',\n    port: 8888,\n    timeout: 30000,\n    reuseExistingServer: true,\n  }\n}\n```\n\nUses Replay.io for debugging, runs on localhost:8888 via Netlify dev server.\n\n### 6. Seed Data for Reviews/Hosts\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (329 lines)\n\n**Users/Hosts:**\n1. **Sarah Chen** (a1111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111) - Host\n   - Email: sarah@example.com\n   - Avatar: https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=sarah\n   - Bio: \"Superhost with 5 years of experience. I love creating memorable stays for my guests.\"\n   - Created: 2021-03-15\n   - Owns properties: b1111111 (Loft, $150/night), b2222222 (Villa, $450/night), b5555555 (Townhouse, $275/night)\n\n2. **Mike Johnson** (a2222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222) - Host\n   - Email: mike@example.com\n   - Avatar: https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=mike\n   - Bio: \"Travel enthusiast and occasional host. Based in Austin, TX.\"\n   - Created: 2022-06-01\n   - Owns properties: b3333333 (Cabin, $200/night), b4444444 (Apartment, $120/night)\n\n3. **Emma Wilson** (a3333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333) - Guest\n   - Email: emma@example.com\n   - Avatar: https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=emma\n\n4. **Alex Rivera** (a4444444-4444-4444-4444-444444444444) - Guest\n   - Email: alex@example.com\n   - Avatar: https://i.pravatar.cc/150?u=alex\n\n**Reviews (2 total):**\n1. Guest Emma on Loft (b1111111) - Rating: 5.0, cleanliness 5, accuracy 5, communication 5, location 5, value 4\n   - Comment: \"Absolutely loved this loft! The city views are even better than the photos. Sarah was a wonderful host. Would definitely stay again.\"\n\n2. Guest Alex on Apartment (b4444444) - Rating: 4.0, cleanliness 4, accuracy 4, communication 5, location 5, value 4\n   - Comment: \"Great location in SoCo. The apartment was clean and well-equipped. The rooftop pool was a nice bonus. Only wish the bedroom was a bit larger.\"\n\n### 7. Netlify Functions\n\n**Reviews-related functions:**\n\n**`/api/reviews.ts`** - GET/POST reviews\n- **GET with guest_id:** Returns reviews written by a guest (with property_title)\n- **GET with property_id:** Returns reviews for a property (with guest_name, guest_avatar)\n- **POST:** Create new review with validation on required fields and duplicate check per booking\n- Fields: booking_id, property_id, guest_id, rating, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value, comment\n\n**Host-related functions:**\n\n**`/api/users/:id`** - GET/PUT user, POST become-host\n- **GET:** Fetch user profile\n- **POST /api/users/:id/become-host:** Convert user to host (sets is_host = true)\n- **PUT:** Update user profile (name, bio, phone, avatar_url)\n\n**`/api/host-stats.ts`** - GET host statistics\n- Query parameter: host_id (required)\n- Returns: totalListings, activeBookings, totalEarnings, avgRating, reviewCount\n- Uses aggregations: COUNT, SUM, AVG on bookings and reviews tables\n\n**`/api/host-listings.ts`** - GET host's properties\n- Query parameter: host_id (required)\n- Returns: All properties with main_image, avg_rating, review_count\n- Ordered by created_at DESC\n\n**`/api/host-bookings.ts`** - GET host's bookings\n- Query parameter: host_id (required)\n- Returns: All bookings for host's properties with property and guest details\n- Includes: property_title, property_city, property_country, property_image, guest_name, guest_email\n- Ordered by created_at DESC\n\n**`/api/users.ts`** - User operations (described above)\n\n---\n\n## Key Files Summary\n\n| Category | Path | Lines | Purpose |\n|----------|------|-------|---------|\n| **BookingCard** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/BookingCard.tsx` | 171 | Booking UI with date/guest selection |\n| **ReviewsSection** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/ReviewsSection.tsx` | 121 | Property reviews display with ratings |\n| **HostInfoCard** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/HostInfoCard.tsx` | 53 | Host profile card on property detail |\n| **UserReviewsList** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/UserReviewsList.tsx` | 85 | User's written reviews on profile |\n| **Config** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/playwright.config.ts` | 34 | Playwright test configuration |\n| **Seeds** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` | 329 | Database seed data (4 users, 5 properties, 2 reviews) |\n| **Tests Docs** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md` | 1373 | Complete test specifications |\n| **Reviews API** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/reviews.ts` | 77 | Reviews CRUD operations |\n| **Host APIs** | `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/host-*.ts` | Various | Host dashboard data |"}],"totalDurationMs":54227,"totalTokens":55655,"totalToolUseCount":33,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":933,"cache_read_input_tokens":51953,"output_tokens":2769,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":933},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
